148
00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:21.759
ta ei olnud mitte kleidis, vaid.

149
00:17:21.859 --> 00:17:23.830
Hommikumantlis.

150
00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.780
Ja te teate,
kuidas seesugused asjad mõnede

151
00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.890
