kuritegu.

161
00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.575
Et.

162
00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:01.685
Nõel.

163
00:20:09.260 --> 00:20:10.480
Vabandan.

164
00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:14.540
Tervist, kas ledi on kodus
ja ta on aias, palun astuke edasi.

165
00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:40.470
Vaadake.

166
00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:42.600
Kallis, mis maaple?

167
00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:46.060
Ma ei. Ma ei tea,
mis minu ümber sünnib.

168
00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:50.340
Minu kuulmine ei ole küll
nii hea kui varem,

169
00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:52.860
